    "updated_at": "2026-11-18T08:09:00Z",
    "body": "Thank you for this issue.\n\nTriage: `enhancement`, `P6` (accepted, not scheduled), `effort:high` (a change to the `.camproj` file, a new command path and an MCP tool), `area:ui`, `area:mcp`. We do not set `source:agent` on issues from outside accounts.\n\nIt depends on #2462, so we will not start it before #2462 merges. Two points for the design:\n- Old projects without the two new values must open without change, and an older CamCraft must still open or clearly refuse a new project.\n- The reimport must stay a command in the undo history, and the operations only go Stale. You already say that CamCraft never regenerates or posts by itself - please keep that in the tests.\n\nTo claim it, comment a line that starts with `claimed:`.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
